{"seq":2,"slug":"option-group-variant-matrix-sku-explosion","title":"选项组、变体矩阵与 SKU 爆炸治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/customization-model-option-variants/option-group-variant-matrix-sku-explosion","wordCount":2958,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"选项组-变体矩阵与-sku-爆炸治理\">选项组、变体矩阵与 SKU 爆炸治理</h1><p>一件可定制的连帽衫，如果没有治理，「颜色 × 尺寸 × 面料 × 三个印花位置 × 每位置的色数 × 字体 × 线色」会让选项空间瞬间到几十万级；而平台原生只给你 3 个选项、2048 个变体（来源：Shopify Help Center，&quot;Add variants&quot;，2026）。「SKU 爆炸」不是形容词，是配置器上线第一周就会撞上的硬墙：导入 CSV 超时、主题渲染卡死、库存表被无意义组合撑满、清关时找不到对应的 GTIN。本文讨论的正是这两层之间的翻译工程——如何把用户能理解的<strong>选项组</strong>，映射成平台能承载的<strong>变体矩阵</strong>，并在两者数量级不匹配时用治理策略收口。它是本 hub 主数据建模的直接延续：上一篇 <code>./3_configurable-product-catalog-data-model.md</code> 定义了父产品、BOM 与选项到物料的映射，本文专攻其中的「组合枚举」这一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-选项组的语义与约束作用域\">核心概念：选项组的语义与约束作用域</h2><p>选项组的划分决定了约束能在哪一层整体声明，也决定了哪些取值有权进入变体矩阵。</p>\n<p>把「颜色」「尺寸」「刻字字体」平铺成一个下拉列表，是配置器最常见的建模错误。选项组（option group / attribute set）的真正作用，是把<strong>共享同一作用域的选项</strong>归在一起，让约束、定价与默认值能够按组整体声明，而不是逐值声明。</p>\n<p>以定制品类为例，选项天然分成三类组，每一类在工程上的行为完全不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>规格组（specification）</strong>：颜色、尺寸、材质。它产生真实的物料差异，每个取值组合对应独立库存与独立成本，是变体矩阵的「主轴」。</li>\n<li><strong>装饰组（decoration）</strong>：印花位置、绣花、刻字。它是加在主体物料上的工序，通常<strong>不产生独立 SKU</strong>，而是作为行项目属性（line item properties）跟随主变体下单。</li>\n<li><strong>个性化组（personalization）</strong>：用户上传的文字、图片、坐标。取值域是无限且不可预知的，<strong>必须</strong>排除在变体矩阵之外，否则矩阵永远无法收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[父产品 / 可配置物] --&gt; B[规格组 Specification]&#10;  A --&gt; C[装饰组 Decoration]&#10;  A --&gt; D[个性化组 Personalization]&#10;  B --&gt;|主轴, 产生物料差异| E[变体矩阵&lt;br/&gt;笛卡尔积枚举]&#10;  C --&gt;|工序, 不产生 SKU| F[行项目属性&lt;br/&gt;随主变体下单]&#10;  D --&gt;|无限取值域| F&#10;  E --&gt; G{枚举数是否超平台上限}&#10;  G --&gt;|未超| H[预生成变体&lt;br/&gt;Pre-generated]&#10;  G --&gt;|超过| I[按需实例化&lt;br/&gt;On-demand]&#10;  G --&gt;|超过且需并排陈列| J[组合式 Listing&lt;br/&gt;Combined Listing]&#10;  I --&gt; K[确定性 SKU 生成器]&#10;  H --&gt; K&#10;  J --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; L[标识治理&lt;br/&gt;GTIN / 条码 / 数据池]\">graph TD\n  A[父产品 / 可配置物] --&gt; B[规格组 Specification]\n  A --&gt; C[装饰组 Decoration]\n  A --&gt; D[个性化组 Personalization]\n  B --&gt;|主轴, 产生物料差异| E[变体矩阵&lt;br/&gt;笛卡尔积枚举]\n  C --&gt;|工序, 不产生 SKU| F[行项目属性&lt;br/&gt;随主变体下单]\n  D --&gt;|无限取值域| F\n  E --&gt; G{枚举数是否超平台上限}\n  G --&gt;|未超| H[预生成变体&lt;br/&gt;Pre-generated]\n  G --&gt;|超过| I[按需实例化&lt;br/&gt;On-demand]\n  G --&gt;|超过且需并排陈列| J[组合式 Listing&lt;br/&gt;Combined Listing]\n  I --&gt; K[确定性 SKU 生成器]\n  H --&gt; K\n  J --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; L[标识治理&lt;br/&gt;GTIN / 条码 / 数据池]</pre><p>分组决定的第二件事是<strong>默认值的作用域</strong>。规格组的默认值应由父产品声明（例如默认红色、默认中号），因为它是「商品本身」的一部分；装饰组与个性化组的默认值必须为空——一个空白印花位置是合法配置，一个自动勾选的付费装饰则是静默加价，属于合规风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变体矩阵-组合数与真实可售集不是一回事\">变体矩阵：组合数与真实可售集不是一回事</h2><p>变体矩阵的朴素定义是各规格组取值域的笛卡尔积。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个规格组有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 个取值，共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个规格组，则理论组合数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>cartesian</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{cartesian}} = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} |A_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cartesian</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个数字增长得极快。Adobe Commerce 的官方文档用 3 色 × 3 码 = 9 个 simple product 来说明「每个变体是带独立 SKU 的独立商品」（来源：Adobe Commerce Admin，<em>Create a configurable product</em>）；但当规格组变成 5 组、每组 8 个取值时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>cartesian</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{cartesian}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cartesian</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>32768</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8^5 = 32768</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32768</span></span></span></span></span>，已经远超平台上限。产品配置器理论（Wikipedia，<em>Product configurator</em>）指出，这类配置空间上的优化问题（例如求成本最小配置）在一般情况下是 <strong>NP 完全的</strong>，因此工程上从不试图枚举全部空间，而是用约束把空间剪枝后再枚举。</p>\n<p>真实可售集是笛卡尔积的一个<strong>真子集</strong>，由约束规则筛出。例如「棉质面料不支持热转印」「大号不支持双面印花」，这些规则把大量组合判为非法。有效的建模是让矩阵只承载<strong>被约束放行</strong>的组合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>sellable</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>Rules</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>valid</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{sellable}} = \\{\\, c \\in \\prod_i A_i \\;\\big|\\; \\text{Rules}(c) = \\text{valid} \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sellable</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rules</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程上的关键判断是：<strong>不要预先枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>cartesian</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V\\_{\\text{cartesian}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cartesian</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 再删除非法项</strong>，而应在枚举时即由规则驱动生成，否则中间产物本身就会撑爆内存与导入通道。约束规则的完整语义（前提条件、选择条件、排除规则）属于本 hub 的规则引擎章节（<code>../2_constraint-rules-cpq-guided-selling/INDEX.md</code>），此处只需记住它对变体矩阵的接口契约：给定一组取值，返回合法/非法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组类型</th>\n<th>是否进入矩阵</th>\n<th>是否产生 SKU</th>\n<th>取值域</th>\n<th>默认值策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规格组</td>\n<td>是（主轴）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>有限、可枚举</td>\n<td>父产品声明默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>装饰组</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>空（不预选）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个性化组</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无限</td>\n<td>空（用户输入）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量/包装</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否（用价格阶梯表达）</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sku-爆炸的四类治理策略\">SKU 爆炸的四类治理策略</h2><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>sellable</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{sellable}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sellable</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过平台上限，只有四种收口方式，选择依据是「是否需要独立库存追踪」与「是否需要在搜索/合集里并排陈列」。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，预生成（pre-generated）</strong>：声明后立即展开全部合法组合为变体记录。读写最快、索引最友好，但直接撞上限——Shopify 的 2048 变体上限就是这条路的硬墙。适合组合数在数百量级、且全部需要独立库存的场景。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，按需实例化（on-demand）</strong>：只声明选项，变体在配置首次被加入订单时才创建。Odoo 用「Instantly / Dynamically / Never」三种变体创建模式表达这件事，其中 <strong>Dynamically</strong> 的定义正是「订单里出现该组合时才创建变体」（来源：Odoo 18 Documentation，<em>Product variants</em>）；文档还特别指出，属性一旦加入产品，其创建模式就不能再更改——这是一个必须在建模期就定死的决策。按需模式把存储量与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 解耦，代价是每次下单都要走一次约束求解，且 SKU 必须在运行时<strong>确定性</strong>生成。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，组合式 Listing（combined listing）</strong>：把多个独立子商品挂到一个父 Listing 下，子商品各自保留自己的变体、媒体与 URL，前台合并陈列。Shopify 的 Combined Listings 允许一个 Listing 挂 <strong>60 个子商品</strong>、跨子商品合计最多 <strong>2048 个变体</strong>，并额外允许 <strong>3 个父级选项</strong>（来源：Shopify Help Center，<em>Combined listings</em>，2026）。它解决的是「每个颜色本身就是独立商品」的品类（如鞋），代价是仅在企业版/Plus 可用。</p>\n<p><strong>其四，属性外置（line item properties / metafields）</strong>：把装饰组与个性化组彻底移出变体体系，作为订单行上的自由属性承载。这也是 Shopify 官方对「需要超过 3 个选项」给出的建议路径——用第三方 App 或主题代码提取行项目属性（来源：Shopify Help Center，<em>Add variants</em>，2026）。它的代价是这些属性无法参与库存扣减与搜索过滤，必须由后端自己做履约侧的校验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标识治理-sku-编码与-gtin-校验\">标识治理：SKU 编码与 GTIN 校验</h2><p>矩阵一旦按需生成，标识就不能再靠人工分配。<strong>内部 SKU</strong> 必须是配置向量到字符串的确定性映射，推荐采用「父编码 + 各规格组取值码按固定顺序拼接 + 分隔符」，例如 <code>HDY-BLK-M-COT</code>。确定性带来了三个收益：同一配置在任何节点重算得到同一 SKU（可跨系统对账）、SKU 可被解析回配置（售后与补单无需查表）、配置变更时能按前缀批量迁移。</p>\n<p>对外标识则必须遵守零售标识体系。GS1 的 <strong>GTIN</strong> 有 8、12、13、14 四种长度，可统一视为 14 位：GTIN-12（UPC-A）补两个前导零、GTIN-13（EAN-13）补一个前导零即可归一到 GTIN-14（来源：Wikipedia，<em>Global Trade Item Number</em>）。GTIN-14 的首位是<strong>指示位</strong>（indicator digit），1–8 表示包装层级、9 表示变量度量商品；其后是厂商前缀与商品参考号。最后一位是校验位，计算方法是：从校验位左侧起，对各位交替乘以 3、1、3、1……求和，取模 10，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(10 - S \\bmod 10) \\bmod 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 得到校验位（来源：Wikipedia，<em>Check digit</em>）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>check</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{check}} = \\left(10 - \\Big(\\sum_{k} w_k \\, d_k \\bmod 10\\Big)\\right) \\bmod 10, \\quad w_k \\in \\{3, 1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">check</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>治理上的红线是：<strong>不是每个变体都配得上一个 GTIN</strong>。GS1 的标识针对的是「贸易项目」，即需要被零售、被物流扫描的独立包装单元；一个只作为工序存在的装饰组合、或一件印着用户自己照片的纯个性化商品，都不构成标准贸易项目。「有变体就发一个 GTIN」会让你的数据池被大量从未上架、永不流通的编码污染，也会在跨境清关时因申报主体与实物不符而被退回。正确的做法是只对规格组产生的、可独立流通的主变体申请 GTIN，其余走内部 SKU。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台约束对照与落地检查清单\">平台约束对照与落地检查清单</h2><p>不同平台的选项/变体模型差异很大，选型时必须以官方上限为准，而不是凭直觉。下表汇总了主流承载能力的真实边界。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>选项上限</th>\n<th>变体上限</th>\n<th>超限后的官方路径</th>\n<th>关键限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Shopify</td>\n<td>3 个选项</td>\n<td>2048 个变体</td>\n<td>行项目属性 / 第三方 App / 组合式 Listing</td>\n<td>超 100 变体时部分主题、App、渠道（含 Stocky）兼容性下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shopify Combined Listing</td>\n<td>父级 3 个选项</td>\n<td>跨子商品 2048</td>\n<td>挂载最多 60 个子商品</td>\n<td>仅 Plus / 企业版可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adobe Commerce</td>\n<td>超级属性不限项数</td>\n<td>无明确上限（= 取值数乘积）</td>\n<td>减少参与生成的取值</td>\n<td>每个变体是独立 simple product，各自建 SKU 与库存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Odoo</td>\n<td>Attribute 不限项数</td>\n<td>取决于创建模式</td>\n<td>用 Dynamically 按需创建</td>\n<td>变体创建模式一旦设定不可更改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>变体主题</td>\n<td>受品类模板约束</td>\n<td>规范的主题组合</td>\n<td>主题必须共享同一核心商品身份，价格/自定义文本不能作主题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>落地时按以下顺序自检，可避开绝大多数 SKU 爆炸事故：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>先分组，再枚举</strong>：确认每个选项归入规格组、装饰组还是个性化组，只有规格组进入矩阵。</li>\n<li><strong>算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∏</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod |A_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，与平台上限对比</strong>：这一步在写任何代码前完成，超限则直接选治理策略。</li>\n<li><strong>约束驱动枚举</strong>，不要先枚举后删除：枚举器接受规则函数作为输入。</li>\n<li><strong>按需模式下验证 SKU 生成器的确定性</strong>：同一配置重复计算须得到同一结果，且可反向解析。</li>\n<li><strong>只对可流通的主变体申请 GTIN</strong>，并校验校验位。</li>\n<li><strong>对装饰/个性化属性做履约侧校验</strong>，因为它们逃逸了库存与搜索的约束。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>把这六步固化成上线前的门控，选项空间的膨胀就从「上线后的救火」变成了「建模期的一次性判断」——这正是 SKU 爆炸治理的全部意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>选项组、变体矩阵与 SKU 治理是同一件事的三个视角：<strong>选项组</strong>决定哪些取值有权参与组合，<strong>变体矩阵</strong>是约束放行后的合法组合集合，<strong>SKU 治理</strong>则是当这个集合超过平台承载能力时的收口手段。核心判断只有两条——第一，永远让约束驱动枚举，而不是枚举后删除；第二，先算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_i |A_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 再决定用预生成、按需实例化、组合式 Listing 还是属性外置，顺序颠倒就是事故。标识侧同样要克制：只对可独立流通的主变体申请 GTIN，并校验其校验位，其余一律走确定性内部 SKU。至于约束规则本身如何表达与求解，见本 hub 的规则引擎章节 <code>../2_constraint-rules-cpq-guided-selling/INDEX.md</code>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"选项组、变体矩阵与 SKU 爆炸治理","id":"选项组-变体矩阵与-sku-爆炸治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：选项组的语义与约束作用域","id":"核心概念-选项组的语义与约束作用域"},{"level":2,"text":"变体矩阵：组合数与真实可售集不是一回事","id":"变体矩阵-组合数与真实可售集不是一回事"},{"level":2,"text":"SKU 爆炸的四类治理策略","id":"sku-爆炸的四类治理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"标识治理：SKU 编码与 GTIN 校验","id":"标识治理-sku-编码与-gtin-校验"},{"level":2,"text":"平台约束对照与落地检查清单","id":"平台约束对照与落地检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"定制商业模式与渠道分布（POD / MTO / ETO / CPQ 的边界与取舍）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/customization-model-option-variants/customization-business-models-channels"},"next":{"title":"可配置产品主数据模型：父产品、BOM 与选项到物料的映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/customization-model-option-variants/configurable-product-catalog-data-model"}}